				"7CD9757E1CD48E5A"
				"25D54E863A28A0AF"
			]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"Dragons have two special stats besides health: Hunger and Happiness. With the &4&nDraconic Codex&r, you can see all your tamed dragons and their needs. In addition, you can view their health, armor value, gender, and location."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/draconic-codex.png width:180 height:100 align:center}"
				"Hunger decreases slowly over time, but drains much faster when riding your dragon, about 4 times as quickly. At 60 hunger and below, they will progressively become weaker until their hunger is less than 30."
				"To increase hunger, feed your dragon their preferred foods or Hearty Dragon Meals. You can view their preferred foods by clicking the green tab on the side of the codex screen."
				"&n&4Happiness&r decreases slowly over time and when your dragon takes damage. Like hunger, happiness will slowly drain your dragon's stats when reaching below 60, making them slower as it drains. At 30% and below, they will not let you ride them at all."
				"Feeding your dragon their preferred foods will increase their happiness, but the primary method is by brushing them."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "3F7EC354D082C371"
