		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4F4F4D2EB4A0F184"]
			description: [
				"The Cindervane is a highly migratory draconic species known for its exceptional endurance and long-distance flight capability. Unlike territorial apex predators, Cindervanes prioritize survival, mobility, and environmental adaptation over prolonged combat engagement. Historically, many ancient civilizations are believed to have relied on established Cindervane migratory routes when constructing trade paths, evacuation corridors, and long-range messenger networks. Cindervanes are also domesticated for the purpose of transportation rather than combat mounts on a daily basis. Their tendency to disperse eggs across wide regions rather than defend centralized nesting grounds has led many researchers to classify the species as ecological carriers rather than territorial rulers. Although not specialized for sustained combat, Cindervanes remain highly dangerous when cornered. &n&4Wild Cindervanes are not hostile unless provoked.&r"
				"Similarly to domesticated wolves and cats, Cindervanes can be tamed through &4&ndirect feeding with preferred foods such as raw chicken, cod, salmon, and Hearty Dragon Meal.&r"
				"Due to their naturally cautious behavior, taming attempts may require multiple feedings before successful domestication occurs."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/cindervane.png width:300 height:180 align:center}"
			]
			id: "0846198E310D721E"
			rewards: [
				{
					amount: 70L
					currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
					id: "3C6C0AF3CD7C67A5"
					ignore_reward_blocking: true
					type: "eternalcurrencies:currency"
				}
				{
					count: 3
