			dependencies: ["1FBE275D5EFEBE58"]
			description: [
				"&4&nBreeding&r requires a pair of &4&none male and one female&r with full health. Shift + Right-click with the dragon's preferred food to initiate breeding. Should you breed one male dragon that you own with a female dragon that someone else owns, or otherwise, the baby will default to following the female. Dragons hatched from eggs made by dragons with different owners are &4&nnot tamed by default&r, but can easily be &4&ntamed by feeding them their preferred foods&r."
				"The Ignivorus Egg is a large, dense, volcanic-black draconic egg marked by hardened ash-gray plating It takes on average &4&n30 minutes for an egg to hatch&r. Being fragile as they are, Silk Touch is required to pick the egg up.  "
				"&4&nThese eggs can be found in Ancient Cities, Nether Fortresses, and the treasure rooms of Bastion Remnants.&r"
			]
