			description: [
				"&4&nBreeding&r requires a pair of &4&none male and one female&r with full health &4&nwhile being underwater&r. Shift + Right-click with the dragon's preferred food to initiate breeding. Should you breed one male dragon that you own with a female dragon that someone else owns, or otherwise, the baby will default to following the female. Dragons hatched from eggs made by dragons with different owners are &4&nnot tamed by default&r, but can easily be &4&ntamed by feeding them their preferred foods&r."
				"The Volitans Egg is a deep blue draconic egg marked by pale underlayer plating and a smooth shell texture resembling submerged stone polished by water currents. Unlike other eggs, Volitans eggs must be waterlogged in order to hatch. It takes on average &4&n15 minutes for an egg to hatch&r. Being fragile as they are, Silk Touch is required to pick the egg up.  "
				"&4&nThese eggs can be found in shipwrecks.&r"
