		{
			dependencies: ["4F4F4D2EB4A0F184"]
			description: [
				"Ivy Oleander is a trader known for her reserved demeanor, extensive travels, and unusually deep understanding of dragon behavior, particularly regarding the Raevyx species. Though outwardly calm and approachable, Ivy is widely associated with the disappearance of numerous Pillager groups and raider encampments across distant regions."
				"Despite maintaining the appearance of an ordinary merchant, rumors surrounding Ivy often describe her as relentless, emotionally detached, and dangerously patient toward those connected to raider activity."
				"To trade with her, one must show a dragon's egg."
