		{
			dependencies: ["4F4F4D2EB4A0F184"]
			description: ["Mossbacks are a species of small amphibian dragons known for being generally weak and slow, serving mostly as annoyances to those travelling through the jungles they call home. While not being especially adept at fighting (or anything, for that matter), Mossbacks face little true hardship and their numbers are limited only by their laziness, as their natural toxic defense allows them freedom from any natural predators. Mossbacks possess a bladder-like organ in their throats that produce immense amounts of a somewhat weak poison, causing them to always be partially inflated and to leak noxious gasses when under any amount of physical pressure. &4&nThey are not only passive when met in the wild, but able to be picked up and thrown as a projectile.&r"]
